**Objective:**
To track and manage cricket player performance, stats, matches, and ranking using Salesforce platform.

**Features Implemented:**
1. Custom Object: Player, Match, Performance
2. Custom Fields: Runs, Wickets, Average, Strike Rate, Role
3. Tabs & Lightning App: CRICK App
4. Flow Automation: Auto-calculate performance score
5. Reports & Dashboard

**Tools:**
Salesforce Developer Org, Flow Builder, Lightning App Builder

